# C06 original draft writer — session transport stays closed

Issue: https://github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-remote-ops/issues/5
Repo: github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-ios
Branch: cursor/c06-original-draft-writer-e504
Base: cursor/c06-same-request-recover-e504 @ 678275ac8898120043170aec67b05472e40e00ea

`MerchantNPCOriginalDraftWriter` calls the existing theme-draft submit, then the
existing read. The submit path is `ApiAiController.themeDraft`:
`POST api/ai/theme/draft`. It is not a second path. The body is the request id
the author flow already holds and the four fields already on the draft
(name, greeting, persona, knowledge).

The read is `MerchantNPCThemeDraftRequestRead`. It uses the request id the
submit response returned. A local held id is not server acceptance. A response
with no returned id does not fall back to that held id, a newly minted UUID, or
a hand-filled id. A response that is not acceptance returns no receipt and does
not publish. A missing publisher does not publish the NPC.

The character page stays the existing character fields. The nested manage page
stays `MerchantStoreCharacterView` plus the manage `NavigationLink` into
`MerchantOperationsDocumentView`. This hunk does not replace either page.

Dot removed the nil snapshot at factory construction. Do not redo that. Do not
read `heldThemeDraftRequestID` or `heldThemeDraftMemberID` at construction.

